  "synthetic": true,
  "notes": [
    "RULINGS Q57d (A14). By code point (= UTF-8 byte order) U+E000 < U+1F600; by UTF-16 code units the emoji (D83D DE00)",
    "sorts first. Record 1 (subject pl:<emoji>, tx 5, validTime t<emoji>) lists wi:<emoji> then wi:<U+E000>; step 2 walks",
    "them by id, so wi:<U+E000> publishes first. Record 2 (subject pl:<U+E000>) publishes wi:b. Record 3 (pl:<emoji>, tx 5,",
    "validTime t<U+E000>) has an equal tx and a smaller validTime by code point: older, skipped (a UTF-16 order would apply it",
    "and publish {late: 1}). Output: items wi:b, wi:<U+E000>, wi:<emoji>; subjects pl:<U+E000>, pl:<emoji>; the payload",
    "keys of wi:<emoji> in the order U+E000, emoji; every non-ASCII character written as \\u escapes (UTF-16 pairs above U+FFFF)."
  ],
